# Bring-up config applied on top of the vendor kona-perf defconfig.
# The public LineageOS drop ships OPLUS feature code compiled in, but several
# OPLUS-only headers/Kconfigs are not published, so their objects must be off
# until phase 3. QPNP_SMB5 pulls in schgm-flash.o, which needs struct smb_charger
# from drivers/power/oplus (missing in this tree). Charging is out of scope
# for the display/touch/GPU bring-up.
# CONFIG_QPNP_SMB5 is not set
